# etch, the sketching window (300 by 300): a left drag draws a free line, a middle drag rubber-bands a straight line drawn on its release,
# a right drag erases, a left press and release draw a segment, then Escape ends the program by itself
drag 1 30 30 200 120
wait
drag 2 40 250 260 200
wait
drag 3 30 30 120 70
wait
move 250 40
press 1
move 270 280
release 1
wait
move 150 150
key Escape
